Yah, semangat, ya.

470
00:20:12,970 --> 00:20:14,740
Terima kasih banyak!

471
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:18,320
Padahal dia sudah beli roti, lo.
Enak.

472
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:21,250
Mungkin maksudnya mendukung?
Sok keren, ya.

473
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:22,790
Jangan bilang begitu, dong.

474
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:25,110
Orang-orang mulai berdatangan, ya!

475
00:20:25,110 --> 00:20:27,070
Lancar, nih, Michinoku!

476
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,520
Halo, Ume.

477
00:20:28,850 --> 00:20:30,520
Minta tiga, ya.

478
00:20:30,710 --> 00:20:31,710
Batsunosuke.

479
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:34,440
Tiga? Terima kasih sudah beli banyak.

480
00:20:34,470 --> 00:20:37,400
Ah, iya. Disuruh Klub Riset Robot...

481
00:20:37,530 --> 00:20:40,960
Bukan, sungguh, maaf...

482
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:44,880
Membelikan untuk orang yang tidak datang
itu curang, tidak, ya?

483
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:48,260
Apalagi tiga buah itu terlalu serakah.

484
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,320
Ini, 210 yen, ya.

485
00:20:49,450 --> 00:20:51,900
Uooh! Onigiri Tiga Generasi!

486
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:52,520
Ekskul Bisbol!

487
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:53,340
Minta lima!

488
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:54,280
Enam!

489
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:55,230
Iya, iya.

490
00:20:55,230 --> 00:20:55,730
Enak!

491
00:20:55,740 --> 00:20:57,400
- Laris banget, ya.
- Rasanya mau naik ke surga...!

492
00:20:57,420 --> 00:20:58,820
Nasi... enak...

493
00:20:59,060 --> 00:21:00,480
Perut... kenyang...

494
00:21:00,490 --> 00:21:01,980
Lagi bencana kelaparan, ya?

495
00:21:01,990 --> 00:21:02,250
NYAM

496
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:04,300
Wah, ini enak juga.

497
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:05,140
Bu Guru.

498
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:08,850
Bisa-bisanya harganya segini.
Pantas laris.

499
00:21:09,320 --> 00:21:11,770
Sampai bisa meyakinkan
Tata Usaha yang keras kepala itu...

500
00:21:11,950 --> 00:21:13,520
Kalian sudah berusaha keras, ya.

501
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:16,400
- Bu Guru, itu sudah dibayar?
- Ibu juga ikut bantu, lo. Ke Michinoku.

502
00:21:16,410 --> 00:21:17,520
Keras kepala...

503
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:19,150
Ibu juga sudah berusaha, ya.

504
00:21:19,290 --> 00:21:21,730
"RUMAH MAKAN KOTOBUKI"
Hebat! Hampir habis terjual!

505
00:21:21,730 --> 00:21:22,590
Benar!

506
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:25,200
Wah, tapi capek juga.

507
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:28,610
Iya. Michinoku, istirahat dulu, yuk.

508
00:21:28,610 --> 00:21:29,730
Hee, onigiri?

509
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:32,660
Eh! Enak!
Beli satu, ah.

510
00:21:32,660 --> 00:21:36,860
Iya. Masih buka... jadi, mampir, ya.

511
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:37,560
Iya.

512
00:21:43,370 --> 00:21:45,540
Untung kita lakukan, ya!

513
00:21:46,300 --> 00:21:46,950
Iya!

514
00:21:47,510 --> 00:21:49,040
Eh, rotinya...

515
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:50,890
Ogah. Makan sendiri sana.

516
00:21:50,890 --> 00:21:52,960
Makanya jangan sok keren.

517
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,490
Aku sudah kenyang, sih.

518
00:21:54,490 --> 00:21:56,490
Kan masih ada mulut bawah.

519
00:21:56,490 --> 00:21:57,700
Ih, menjijikkan!

520
00:21:59,080 --> 00:22:01,060
"SETELAH INI DIMAKAN DENGAN NIKMAT"
Mau makan pakai mulut bawah?!

521
00:22:01,060 --> 00:22:03,420
Duh, ya sudah, deh! Aku bantu!

522
00:22:03,420 --> 00:22:05,320
Tidak jadi, kubawa pulang saja.

523
00:23:34,990 --> 00:23:35,970
CUPLIKAN EPISODE BERIKUTNYA

524
00:23:35,970 --> 00:23:38,920
DUNIA SATOMI, KALAU SEMUA BERKUMPUL,
TIPU DAYA TAN, UME DIDUGA PLAYBOY,

525
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:41,880
SAKIT, SAKIT, TERBANGLAH!,
BERES-BERES DAN BUAH DADA

